#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "DataListRow"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Primary row in a data list (tasks, mail threads, …): title, actions, selection, optional drag, overflow menu.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Slots:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Slot                         | Role                                                                    |\n"
"| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Leading control              | Complete checkbox, or selection glyph in `selectionMode`                |\n"
"| Title                        | Primary truncated text                                                  |\n"
"| Secondary line / tags / meta | Optional muted line, tags, due date, entity id                          |\n"
"| Persistent actions           | Always-visible controls needed without hover (e.g. touch ⋯)             |\n"
"| Hover actions                | Pointer-only revealed controls (`group-hover`) when used                |\n"
"| Overflow menu source         | Shared `ActionSheetItem[]` for ContextMenu and ActionSheet              |\n"
"| Drag handle                  | Prefer **whole-row** drag listeners; no separate handle unless required |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**States:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| State         | Visual / behavior                                                                 |\n"
"| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| default       | Row chrome; `min-h-11`                                                            |\n"
"| hover         | `hover:bg-muted` (pointer); must not be the only way to discover actions on touch |\n"
"| active        | Current detail target (subtle ring/bg) when not selected                          |\n"
"| selected      | Stronger primary tint + ring; used in multi-select                                |\n"
"| selectionMode | Checkbox → selection glyph; click toggles; disable drag/menus                     |\n"
"| dragging      | Reduced opacity; grab cursor when draggable                                       |\n"
"| disabled      | Controls disabled; no drag                                                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:54 docs/ui/patterns.md:78 docs/ui/patterns.md:102
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dimension adaptation:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n"
"| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Same slot contract across modules; do not ship a second row component per breakpoint                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| Layout      | Outer List-Detail / columns change; **row slots stay the same** in compact and expanded                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| Interaction | **pointer:** hover bg; right-click `ContextMenu` when enabled; optional hover-revealed actions. **touch:** no hover-only actions; persistent ⋯ (or equivalent); long-press → ActionSheet; hit targets ≥44px |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n"
"| Forbidden   | `getShellKind()` to choose menu type; viewport width to choose ContextMenu vs ActionSheet; custom `fixed` coordinate menus                                                                                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Implementation:** Reference — [`TaskItemRowView.tsx`](../../src/ui-kit/composite/TaskItemRowView.tsx) (+ list wrapper `TaskItemListView`). Capability flags: `useActionSheet`, `contextMenuEnabled`, drag attrs/listeners from parent.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Compliance:** Reference implementation (task-shaped). **Pending extraction:** domain-agnostic `ListRow` chassis. **Pending alignment:** other modules’ custom rows that diverge on menus/selection/drag.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "OverflowMenu"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Secondary actions on an object without cluttering the row.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Slots:** Item list (`ActionSheetItem[]`: label, action, destructive flag, …); optional trigger (⋯).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "**States:** Closed / open; destructive items styled distinctly; disabled when `selectionMode` or row disabled.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | One item builder; both surfaces consume the same array                                                                                    |\n"
"| Layout      | ActionSheet may present as bottom sheet; ContextMenu is anchored — presentation details follow primitives                                 |\n"
"| Interaction | **pointer:** `ContextMenu`. **touch:** `ActionSheet` + long-press and/or ⋯. Separate state machines; shared session data (target + items) |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Parallel hand-rolled menus; `window.confirm` inside menu actions for irreversible deletes (use ConfirmDestructive)                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Implementation:** `@freeanima/ui-kit/composite` — `ContextMenu`, `ActionSheet`, `useLongPress`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:90 docs/ui/patterns.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Compliance:** Reference.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "ConfirmDestructive"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Confirm irreversible or high-risk actions (delete, purge).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Slots:** Title, description, cancel, confirm (destructive/error variant).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "**States:** Open/closed; confirm button must **not** be default-focused or “easy Enter” default.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Second confirmation for irreversible delete; `showConfirm` / `ConfirmDialog` |\n"
"| Layout      | Dialog vs Sheet presentation may follow ModalSheetPresent                    |\n"
"| Interaction | Same confirm semantics on pointer and touch                                  |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                          |\n"
"| Forbidden   | `window.confirm`; `autoFocus` on confirm                                     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Implementation:** `ConfirmDialog`, `showConfirm` from `@freeanima/ui-kit/composite`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "ModalSheetPresent"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Modal content presentation that tracks **layout**, not shell.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Slots:** Title, body, footer actions; optional close.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Same content model                                                                    |\n"
"| Layout      | **expanded:** centered `Dialog`. **compact:** bottom `Sheet` / sheet-like surface     |\n"
"| Interaction | Opening gesture is separate (button vs long-press); do not conflate with presentation |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                                   |\n"
"| Forbidden   | `getShellKind() === \"tauri\"` ⇒ Sheet                                                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Implementation:** shadcn `Dialog` / `Sheet`; pickers such as `MoveToListPicker` follow the same idea.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/patterns.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Compliance:** Reference (with **pending alignment** on ad-hoc z-index values).\n"
msgstr ""

